          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="recently-item">
          <span class="recently-title">Brooklyn Community Board 6</span>
          <p class="recently-desc">I currently sit on the land use/housing subcommittee, where I weigh in on hyperlocal issues impacting my community.</p>
        </li>

        <li class="recently-item">
          <span class="recently-title">Other fun</span>
          <p class="recently-desc">I'm currently training for my first ever half marathon, and I wrote about it <a href="https://lenahan.substack.com/p/running" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>. My favorite activity in the world is playing music with other people — I've played in an indie rock band, an ottoman music ensemble, and a collaborative orchestra. You can also find me on <a href="https://lenahan.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Substack</a> and <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/63092098-lena" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Goodreads</a>. One day, I'd love to moonlight as a matchmaker.</p>
        </li>

      </ul>

      <p class="updated">Last updated Feb 2026</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .also-page {
    padding: 3rem;
    min-height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .recently-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .recently-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .recently-title {
    font-size: 0.77rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .recently-title a {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .recently-desc {
    font-size: 0.70rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .recently-desc a {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .recently-desc a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    background: #fef08a;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1px 3px;
    margin: 0 -3px;
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: 0.61rem;
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0.45;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Platform links */
  .platform-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .platform-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1;
    border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .platform-link:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .platform-link svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .also-page {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      min-height: auto;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .platform-links {
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .platform-link {
      padding: 0.15rem 0.3rem;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .platform-link svg {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
    }
  }
</style>
